Comment=Write letters, reports and CVs, and open and save Word files
Comment[fr]=Écrivez des lettres, des rapports et des CV, et ouvrez et enregistrez des fichiers Word
Comment[nl]=Schrijf brieven, rapporten en cv's, en open en bewaar Word-bestanden
Comment[de]=Schreiben Sie Briefe, Berichte und Lebensläufe und öffnen und speichern Sie Word-Dateien
Comment[es]=Escribe cartas, informes y currículos, y abre y guarda archivos de Word
Comment[it]=Scrivi lettere, relazioni e CV, e apri e salva file Word
Comment[pt]=Escreva cartas, relatórios e currículos, e abra e guarde ficheiros Word
Comment[pl]=Pisz listy, raporty i CV oraz otwieraj i zapisuj pliki Worda
Comment[ar]=اكتب الرسائل والتقارير والسير الذاتية، وافتح ملفات Word واحفظها
Comment[cs]=Pište dopisy, zprávy a životopisy a otevírejte a ukládejte soubory Wordu
Comment[el]=Γράψτε επιστολές, αναφορές και βιογραφικά, και ανοίξτε και αποθηκεύστε αρχεία Word
Comment[hi]=पत्र, रिपोर्ट और बायोडाटा लिखें, और Word फ़ाइलें खोलें और सहेजें
Comment[hu]=Levelek, jelentések és önéletrajzok írása, Word-fájlok megnyitása és mentése
Comment[id]=Tulis surat, laporan, dan CV, serta buka dan simpan berkas Word
Comment[ja]=手紙、レポート、履歴書を作成し、Word ファイルを開いて保存する
Comment[ko]=편지, 보고서, 이력서를 작성하고 Word 파일을 열고 저장합니다
Comment[pt_BR]=Escreva cartas, relatórios e currículos, e abra e salve arquivos do Word
Comment[ro]=Scrieți scrisori, rapoarte și CV-uri, și deschideți și salvați fișiere Word
Comment[ru]=Пишите письма, отчёты и резюме, открывайте и сохраняйте файлы Word
Comment[sv]=Skriv brev, rapporter och CV:n, och öppna och spara Word-filer
Comment[tr]=Mektup, rapor ve özgeçmiş yazın, Word dosyalarını açın ve kaydedin
Comment[uk]=Пишіть листи, звіти й резюме, відкривайте та зберігайте файли Word
Comment[vi]=Viết thư, báo cáo và sơ yếu lý lịch, đồng thời mở và lưu tệp Word
Comment[zh_CN]=撰写信函、报告和简历，打开和保存 Word 文件
Comment[zh_TW]=撰寫信件、報告和履歷，開啟及儲存 Word 檔案
Comment[nb]=Skriv brev, rapporter og CV-er, og åpne og lagre Word-filer
Comment[da]=Skriv breve, rapporter og CV'er, og åbn og gem Word-filer
Comment[fi]=Kirjoita kirjeitä, raportteja ja ansioluetteloita sekä avaa ja tallenna Word-tiedostoja
Comment[th]=เขียนจดหมาย รายงาน และประวัติย่อ รวมถึงเปิดและบันทึกไฟล์ Word
Comment[ms]=Tulis surat, laporan dan CV, serta buka dan simpan fail Word
Comment[fil]=Sumulat ng mga liham, ulat at CV, at magbukas at mag-save ng mga Word file
Comment[bn]=চিঠি, রিপোর্ট ও সিভি লিখুন এবং Word ফাইল খুলুন ও সংরক্ষণ করুন
Comment[ta]=கடிதங்கள், அறிக்கைகள், சுயவிவரங்களை எழுதவும்; Word கோப்புகளைத் திறக்கவும், சேமிக்கவும்
Comment[te]=లేఖలు, నివేదికలు, CVలు రాయండి మరియు Word ఫైళ్లను తెరవండి, సేవ్ చేయండి
Comment[mr]=पत्रे, अहवाल आणि सीव्ही लिहा आणि Word फायली उघडा व सेव्ह करा
Comment[sk]=Píšte listy, správy a životopisy a otvárajte a ukladajte súbory Wordu
Comment[bg]=Пишете писма, доклади и автобиографии, отваряйте и записвайте файлове на Word
Comment[hr]=Piši pisma, izvješća i životopise te otvaraj i spremaj Word datoteke
Comment[sr]=Пиши писма, извештаје и биографије, те отварај и чувај Word датотеке
Comment[sl]=Pišite pisma, poročila in življenjepise ter odpirajte in shranjujte datoteke Word
Comment[lt]=Rašykite laiškus, ataskaitas ir gyvenimo aprašymus, atidarykite ir įrašykite Word failus
Comment[lv]=Rakstiet vēstules, atskaites un CV, atveriet un saglabājiet Word failus
Comment[et]=Kirjuta kirju, aruandeid ja CV-sid ning ava ja salvesta Wordi faile
Comment[ca]=Escriu cartes, informes i currículums, i obre i desa fitxers de Word
Exec=wildos-write %U
Icon=org.wildos.write
Terminal=false
StartupNotify=true
StartupWMClass=libreoffice-writer
Categories=Office;WordProcessor;
Keywords=word;docx;doc;document;letter;report;cv;odt;writer;
X-GIO-NoFuse=true
InitialPreference=9
MimeType=application/clarisworks;application/docbook+xml;application/macwriteii;application/msword;application/prs.plucker;application/rtf;application/vnd.apple.pages;application/vnd.lotus-wordpro;application/vnd.ms-word;application/vnd.ms-word.document.macroEnabled.12;application/vnd.ms-word.template.macroEnabled.12;application/vnd.ms-works;application/vnd.oasis.opendocument.text;application/vnd.oasis.opendocument.text-flat-xml;application/vnd.oasis.opendocument.text-master;application/vnd.oasis.opendocument.text-master-template;application/vnd.oasis.opendocument.text-template;application/vnd.oasis.opendocument.text-web;application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document;application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.template;application/vnd.palm;application/vnd.stardivision.writer-global;application/vnd.sun.xml.writer;application/vnd.sun.xml.writer.global;application/vnd.sun.xml.writer.template;application/vnd.wordperfect;application/wordperfect;application/x-abiword;application/x-aportisdoc;application/x-doc;application/x-fictionbook+xml;application/x-hwp;application/x-iwork-pages-sffpages;application/x-mswrite;application/x-pocket-word;application/x-sony-bbeb;application/x-starwriter;application/x-starwriter-global;application/x-t602;text/rtf;
Actions=NewDocument;

[Desktop Action NewDocument]
Name=New document
Exec=wildos-write --new
